  <HH.Setting.kitchen.poisonRule>No food poisoning from a good kitchen</HH.Setting.kitchen.poisonRule>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.poisonRule.Desc>Plates cooked by a cook with Cooking 4 or more in a clean kitchen (cleanliness -0.2 or better) can never poison. Off: vanilla rolls apply.</HH.Setting.kitchen.poisonRule.Desc>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.variants>Fine and Signature forms</HH.Setting.kitchen.variants>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.variants.Desc>Offer each dish in a Fine form (more and better ingredients, a better chance for good quality) and a Signature form (research needed).</HH.Setting.kitchen.variants.Desc>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.allKnown>All dishes known</HH.Setting.kitchen.allKnown>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.allKnown.Desc>Skip learning: every dish of the menu can be cooked as soon as its devices stand.</HH.Setting.kitchen.allKnown.Desc>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.cookSounds>Cooking and eating sounds</HH.Setting.kitchen.cookSounds>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.cookSounds.Desc>Every kind of cooking (chopping, simmering, grilling, baking, frying, steaming, kneading, smoking, chilling) has its own sound and little effect, finished fine dishes ring a cue and good plates get a happy reaction. Off: the vanilla pan-frying sound for everything.</HH.Setting.kitchen.cookSounds.Desc>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.darkMenu>Dark menu (long pork)</HH.Setting.kitchen.darkMenu>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.darkMenu.Desc>Allow the long pork dishes. Always needs content intensity Dark or Grim; with that, an ideoligion that approves of cannibalism unlocks them even when this is off.</HH.Setting.kitchen.darkMenu.Desc>
